<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h0df1a5e4g0a41g4494g89afga91d8b2d0e80" version="2">受到你&lt;b&gt;主要&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;傷害的敵人必須通過一次&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Wisdom"&gt;感知&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="STUNNED"&gt;震懾&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;回合。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;取決於你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1bb42a7dgb7f7g40d5gb604gc72339421418" version="2">Targets of your throwing attacks additionally take &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; and fall &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="PRONE"&gt;Prone&lt;/LSTag&gt; unless they succeed a &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Dexterity Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; against your &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e90c828g16a3g4c77g8a1dg86316c483257" version="2">當處於&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="TAD_SHIELD_OF_THRALLS"&gt;不穩定護盾&lt;/LSTag&gt;效果下時，你的法術和戲法迫使目標進行一次&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Wisdom"&gt;感知&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將陷入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CONFUSION"&gt;困惑&lt;/LSTag&gt;狀態，持續&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;回合。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;取決於你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;，但不等同於它。</content>
	<content contentuid="h21d51d2agdb5dg453ag98fag467eec8d486f" version="2">&lt;br&gt;當一名&lt;b&gt;類人生物&lt;/b&gt;攻擊你時，他們必須通過一次&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Wisdom"&gt;感知&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則將成爲你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DOMINATE_PERSON"&gt;盟友&lt;/LSTag&gt;，持續&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;回合。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DC效力隨你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;提升。</content>
	<content contentuid="h27b25750g8b7fg455agafd4gfa2d2b8a73bb" version="2">造成&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;時，你迫使敵人進行一次對抗你&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Wisdom"&gt;感知&lt;/LSTag&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;；若失敗，則陷入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MADNESS"&gt;瘋狂&lt;/LSTag&gt;，持續&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;回合。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3ca83842gac6ag4d4fga179ge2bf3f212373" version="2">當你對其造成&lt;b&gt;任何&lt;/b&gt;傷害時，目標必須通過一次體質&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則會獲得&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;層&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="WEAPON104"&gt;衰老詛咒&lt;/LSTag&gt;。你也有&lt;b&gt;[2]%&lt;/b&gt;的幾率獲得&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;層此詛咒。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;取決於你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6edad1a2ge16bg4b65gace4g170c65df85b8" version="2">Dealing damage with the Stoker forces the target to make a Charisma &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; against your &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;, or fall into &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HIDEOUS_LAUGHTER"&gt;uncontrollable laughter&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; turns.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Triggers no more than &lt;b&gt;once&lt;/b&gt; per turn.</content>
	<content contentuid="ha29c5e5fgac3bg4533ga5d2g78316afff39c" version="2">祈求先祖，迫使天空之靈服從你，向敵人釋放閃電力量。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Type="Image" Info="SoftWarning"/&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;效果等同於你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hfdfa632eg75f0g4df5g94c0gae81bcd05ef9" version="2">受到此手斧傷害的目標必須通過一次體質&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;，否則會陷入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="WEAPON96"&gt;冰冷之擁&lt;/LSTag&gt;狀態，直到其下個回合結束。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免&lt;/LSTag&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;取決於你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;威能豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf5e82dedgec16g4812gb95cg51a2f457432a" version="2">威能豁免等級</content>
	<content contentuid="h43bbe768ge4d7g43a9gb814g5a3020e2429a" version="2">最強大的效果迫使目標進行&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免&lt;/LSTag&gt;時所需達到的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;難度等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;取你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MANEUVER_SAVE_DC"&gt;戰技豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;與&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SpellDifficultyClass"&gt;法術豁免等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;中的較高值，再 + &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;。&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;實際數值請查看戰鬥記錄。</content>
</contentList>
